.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_exported_nvm_subsys_list" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_exported_nvm_subsys_list \- Exported NVM Subsystems List Data Structure, returned by the Manage Exported NVM Subsystem Receive command's List Exported NVM Subsystems management operation
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_exported_nvm_subsys_list {
.br
.BI "    __le16 n;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd2;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 gn;"
.br
.BI "    struct nvme_exported_nvm_subsys_descriptor entries[];"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "n" 12
Number of Exported NVM Subsystem Descriptors (N)
.IP "rsvd2" 12
Reserved
.IP "gn" 12
Generation Number (GN)
.IP "entries" 12
Exported NVM Subsystem Descriptor list, see \fIstruct
nvme_exported_nvm_subsys_descriptor\fP
